      "rationale": "Drains the durable invalidation queue (edge-cache:purge, ADR-0042, sql/068) every minute and issues one Varnish BAN per surrogate key — a recurring dispatcher, not a tolerant-of-delay sweep: lag here means stale content served to real visitors."
    },
